{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0655a6a06109ff9d2f40154fa0aeb6dbbd0323976b6865b0b06d0925b3790817", "ja": "（千早の新しい衣装が届いた。\n試着をしてもらっているのだが、いつになく真剣だ）", "zh": "（千早的新服装送到了。\n虽然正在让她试穿，但她比平时都要认真）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4adec6b66e5253604b2a11547c9084e18613a555e5677d54893c424f6528ca60", "ja": "千早、お疲れ様。どうした？\nもしかして、衣装に何か不備でも？", "zh": "千早，辛苦了。怎么了？\n难道是服装有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "d7772a0df21adbe6b665684c47398a5fc3f219adc52fb4e2de9db9ce8fc6ecd1", "ja": "いえ、そういうわけでは。私が想像していたより\n何倍もカッコよくて、とても素敵だと思います。", "zh": "不，并不是那样。它比我想象中的\n还要帅气好几倍，我觉得非常棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0e67bd143c4a58ab88ca463ebb7a18779838010002959a312d0a155c06b9399e", "ja": "そうか。いや、じっと見つめてたから、\n何かあったのかと思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。不是，我看你一直盯着看，还以为发生什么事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "238fbee4834ce695441e67a39abc09559c17aa05f724c4229ed0666fcbb1edb3", "ja": "すみません。実は……こうして衣装を着てみたら、\n色々考えることが生まれてきて。", "zh": "抱歉。其实……穿上这套服装后，我开始思考起许多事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "69cd251f042d0d7cbef8aed1cc84a8375631129033527d398d14f30be4802f8e", "ja": "この衣装でステージに立つ、その瞬間……私は、\n歌にどんなメッセージを込めるべきなのか、と。", "zh": "穿着这身服装站上舞台的那一刻……我在想，自己究竟该在歌声中寄托怎样的信息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7ad21e63a61df3b207ea63764307e6429c9d878a7e33763f1ce3aa0bf2b651ac", "ja": "込めるべきメッセージ……。\nその衣装で役柄を演じるからこその悩みってことか。", "zh": "应该要传达的信息……也就是说，这是只有穿上那套服装、演绎那个角色才会有的烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "95c78fedf95caa92dfcddddc0554a929570d93d0a0ab98a7966a6378dd671db9", "ja": "はい。この服は、チハヤがレジスタンスとして\n戦っている時に着ていたもの……彼女の戦闘服です。", "zh": "是的。这身衣服是千早作为抵抗组织成员战斗时穿的……也就是她的战斗服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "410d620942e18c37dd2ff9764620cdd686974fcea5fb5a618831df1023add1e1", "ja": "村人や仲間への思いや、政府への不満……。\nきっと、様々なことを考えていたと思います。", "zh": "我想，她一定思考过许多事情吧。\n对村民和同伴的牵挂……以及对政府的不满……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "799bc7d8836d68f6d1ea009b8919580c1de8e5200f4033b2d9e8fda0691383ce", "ja": "感情一つで、歌の印象は大きく変わります。\n果たして衣装に合わせるべきか、それとも……。", "zh": "仅仅一种情感，就能让歌曲给人的印象发生很大变化。\n究竟该配合服装，还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7bd6d11616703021541e489801239acf5a761e309c05c081b879860cb3728d85", "ja": "なるほど……メッセージを発信するのは、\nチハヤなのか、それとも千早本人なのか。", "zh": "原来如此……传达出这份信息的，\n究竟是千早，还是千早本人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1012_p", "source_sha256": "060cb566add0fcbceed5ec90d7bf26d1aa737f392372cf3c4b4a5fde979e05eb", "ja": "そうだな……。個人的な意見を言うと、\nどちらも、歌に乗せて届けていいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "是啊……要我说个人意见的话，\n两边都可以借由歌声传达出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "ac7ee07e6afc31f250dc86803023b0bbc1ebf4dd1d07fd3fcc760bf96138de1d", "ja": "いいんですか？　決して明るい感情ではないですし、\nいつも通りのパフォーマンスになるかは……。", "zh": "可以吗？这绝不是什么明朗的情感，\n而且也不知道能不能发挥出和平时一样的水准……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1014_p", "source_sha256": "eba7b041427610d8835cf9d301aa6e813760db943eada4c84bb571dfae179e7a", "ja": "それは当然だよ。\n千早の歌に、チハヤの思いを込めるんだから。", "zh": "那是当然的。\n毕竟要把千早的心情融入千早的歌声中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d304c774ff99a0ec998553703fb01c0aeb7861df8e939b09aa23695156aa1686", "ja": "役者として受け取った感情を、歌い手として\nみんなに伝える。千早にしか出来ないことだと思うよ。", "zh": "把作为演员体会到的情感，作为歌手\n传达给大家。我认为这是唯有千早才能做到的事哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "d4f01bcd8fb9de78faa1ffd473d9231eb8ffdc7f8515ba8f1083434a1aedae97", "ja": "私にしか……。\n……うん、そうですね。", "zh": "只有我才能……嗯，确实如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "0dc373e8c8e14c07ab667c56e2b557407eb3407e53437d7c067ffa85f74106ac", "ja": "この衣装だからこそ見せられる、特別。みんなにそう\n思ってもらえるステージにできればいいんですよね。", "zh": "只有这身服装才能展现的特别之处。要是能打造出让大家都这么想的舞台就好了，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5111c4d948d4307a79e5ec376c266d8b7f1edb199e5f5e9a339e8c1511cdc449", "ja": "ああ。二人分の思いを乗せた歌を聞いたら、\nみんな、喜んでくれると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯。大家听到承载着两个人心意的歌，一定会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "21c3cfcfce89db182d06f64eb76b26127f2c27c784542aaf1b006902bb818089", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n……本当は、やりたい気持ちが大きかったんです。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n……其实，我内心里很想去唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "50beb3bd3e9cdb0a067b9c03ec36612c3a7709d886e52e93044def347aa3f7be", "ja": "でも、なかなか踏み出せなくて。\n{$P$}に相談して、よかったです。", "zh": "不过，我一直很难迈出那一步。\n能和{$P$}商量，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0534_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0534_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "1637010bb04f2d92ef7231dc2b86b3914561cfffa69f3670cec11f678b1b519e", "ja": "衣装に宿る、彼女の想い。\nみんなへ届けられるよう、精いっぱい歌いますね。", "zh": "寄托在衣装中，她的心意。\n我会竭尽全力地歌唱，愿它能传达给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
